      "id": "msg_0495_T07R0102_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "I just recently became a Trainer.\f",
        "My son encouraged me to do it.\r",
        "I’m impressed by the selection of\n",
        "convenient items."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0495_T07R0102_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "My dad’s having a hard time learning\n",
        "the names of items and how they are\f",
        "supposed to be used..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0495_T07R0102_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Top Grade Items for Trainers!\n",
        "2F: Trainer’s Market"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0495_T07R0102_00003",
      "en_US": "Wake: Hmm... Hmm... Humm...\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0495_T07R0102_00004",
      "en_US": "Wake: Ha! This is quite a mask...\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0495_T07R0102_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Wake: Huh? You talking to me?\r",
        "Your eyes...are on my\n",
        "Crasher Wake mask?\r",
        "No, no, no!\n",
        "I can never let it go!\r",
        "...\n",
        "Huh? That’s not it?\f",
        "You want the other mask?\r",
        "Hmm.\n",
        "OK.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0495_T07R0102_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Wake: What?\n",
        "That’s not enough?\r",
        "You’re quite a negotiator for your\n",
        "age... All right, I’ll give you this, too!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0495_T07R0102_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Wake: ...\r",
        "Arrr, all right, all right! I will give you\n",
        "this much-valued one as well!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0495_T07R0102_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Wake: It’s OK.\n",
        "I’ve already paid for you.\r",
        "Presents for you from the one\n",
        "who wears masks the best.\f",
        "Don’t be shy.\f",
        "Ha ha ha!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0495_T07R0102_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Wake: Hmm... Hmm... Humm...\r",
        "Ha! This is quite a mask..."
      ]
    }
